# An allowlist: this repo is public, the texts it learns from are not (RELATIONS.md, section 6). Everything is ignored
# except code, docs and reports, the licences and the free derived lists below; anything new stays local until it is
# admitted here on purpose. The pre-commit hook (tools/screen.py) screens what is admitted.
*
!*/
!*.py
!*.sh
!*.md
!/LICENSE
!/LICENSE-docs
!/.gitignore
!/.githooks/
!/.githooks/*
!/tools/screen_allow.txt
# function words derived from free alignments (never hebm95_func.txt: HEBM95 is © Bible Society in Israel)
!/lab/rules/data/dan_func.txt
!/lab/rules/data/vamvas_func.txt
!/lab/rules/data/hebnt_func.txt

# never, even where a pattern above admits it
/private/
/CLAUDE.local.md
__pycache__/
